      "cooked": "<p>Encountered a strange bug with Chastise. &nbsp;Fanatic played Chastise on Targeting Innocents. &nbsp;Ennead played Desert's Wrath and destroys Targeting Innocents, leaving a free standing Chastise. &nbsp;At the start of Fanatic's turn, she is not offered the opportunity to deal herself damage to keep Chastise in play, but it stays in play anyhow. &nbsp;Played on Android, so I don't have a game log.</p>",
